INFOTEXT:Pathfinder class variants rewritten by this project into 3.5e PCGen syntax. Base classes come from the 3.5e RSRD; this extension only adds PF's variant/archetype abilities. Not a copy of the official PCGen Pathfinder dataset. See docs/PF35E_EXTENSION.md for scope and known gaps.

